          "en": "this is what you got.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 25.54,
          "end": 28,
          "en": "You essentially got two main routes,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 28,
          "end": 30.2,
          "en": "all products and add product,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 30.2,
          "end": 35.05,
          "en": "here you can well add a new product,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 35.05,
          "end": 36.9,
          "en": "and then you see it here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 36.9,
          "end": 39.44,
          "en": "And we face a couple of problems",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 39.44,
          "end": 44.33,
          "en": "or uncertainties here when using the composition API.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 44.33,
          "end": 47.6,
          "en": "For example, when I add a new product",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 47.6,
          "end": 49.14,
          "en": "and I click add product,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 49.14,
          "end": 52.5,
          "en": "it would be great if I would automatically be redirected",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 52.5,
          "end": 54.21,
          "en": "to all products.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 54.21,
          "end": 56.85,
          "en": "In addition, when I click view details here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 56.85,
          "end": 60,
          "en": "I wanna see the details for that product.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 60,
          "end": 63.67,
          "en": "And why is that complicated with decomposition API,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 63.67,
          "end": 65.86,
          "en": "at least at the moment,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 65.86,
          "end": 68.62,
          "en": "because we don't know how to get that data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 68.62,
          "end": 70.34,
          "en": "on this route, for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 70.34,
          "end": 73.593,
          "en": "because we don't know how to navigate programmatically.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 74.6,
          "end": 76.86,
          "en": "Without decomposition API",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 76.86,
          "end": 80.62,
          "en": "we knew that there was this dollar sign router",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 80.62,
          "end": 83.11,
          "en": "and this dollar sign route.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 83.11,
          "end": 84.52,
          "en": "So for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 84.52,
          "end": 87.08,
          "en": "the product details page it's loaded",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 87.08,
          "end": 88.75,
          "en": "for slash products,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 88.75,
          "end": 90.893,
          "en": "and then this dynamic segment.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 91.75,
          "end": 95.71000000000001,
          "en": "Now we learned in the routing module of this course",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 95.71000000000001,
          "end": 100.22999999999999,
          "en": "that we can get the concrete value for this dynamic segment",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 100.22999999999999,
          "end": 102.66,
          "en": "inside of the product details here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 102.66,
          "end": 107.37,
          "en": "with this dollar sign route object.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 107.37,
          "end": 110.1,
          "en": "The problem with decomposition API",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 110.1,
          "end": 114.21000000000001,
          "en": "is that there is no this keyword in the setup method.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 114.21000000000001,
          "end": 117.493,
          "en": "So how do we get our route parameters here then?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 118.44,
          "end": 122.22,
          "en": "Well, there are two ways of fixing this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 122.22,
          "end": 125.14,
          "en": "For one you can, of course use an approach,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 125.14,
          "end": 127.61,
          "en": "which has showed you into routing module.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 127.61,
          "end": 130.43,
          "en": "You can configure this route,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 130.43,
          "end": 134.69,
          "en": "such that the dynamic segment is passed as a prop",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 134.69,
          "end": 137.12,
          "en": "into the to be loaded component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 137.12,
          "end": 140.17000000000002,
          "en": "simply by adding this props option",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 140.17000000000002,
          "end": 143.233,
          "en": "on the route config and setting it to true.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 144.55,
          "end": 149.55,
          "en": "Now the value for PID product ID will be provided",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 149.57999999999998,
          "end": 153.27,
          "en": "as a prop in the product details component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 153.27,
          "end": 154.103,
          "en": "And you know,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 154.103,
          "end": 156.61,
          "en": "that we get props as a first argument here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 156.61,
          "end": 158.29,
          "en": "in the setup method.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 158.29,
          "end": 159.46,
          "en": "So now with that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 159.46,
          "end": 164.46,
          "en": "we could then use inject to inject the products",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 165.36,
          "end": 168.82,
          "en": "which I'm managing and providing here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 168.82,
          "end": 172.423,
          "en": "in app view into product details.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 173.39,
          "end": 178.34,
          "en": "So here we can get our products by calling inject products,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 178.34,
          "end": 181.15,
          "en": "injecting the provided products",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 181.15,
          "end": 185.67,
          "en": "and on our props, we'll get this PID prop,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 185.67,
          "end": 190.67,
          "en": "which holds the value off the dynamic segment in the URL.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 191.21,
          "end": 194.52,
          "en": "So here in product details,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 194.52,
          "end": 199.397,
          "en": "we can then get our selected product",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 200.59,
          "end": 202.86,
          "en": "by reaching out to products.",
